  "description": "Modern .NET 8 IRC client library with full IRCv3 support — SASL, message tags, capabilities negotiation, CTCP (VERSION/PING/ACTION), WebSocket and TCP/SSL transports, rate limiting, auto-reconnect, and 39 typed events. Based on RFC 1459 and the Modern IRC Client Protocol.",
