  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0:\n- New events: InviteReceived, OwnAwayStatusChanged (305/306), ChannelModeIsReceived (324), ErrorReplyReceived (catch-all)\n- Fix: ERR_NOCHANMODES (477) and ERR_TOOMANYCHANNELS (405) now route to ChannelJoinFailed\n- Fix: ERR_CHANOPRIVSNEEDED (482), ERR_NOTONCHANNEL (442), ERR_NEEDMOREPARAMS (461) now route to ErrorReplyReceived\n- Fix: Case-insensitive channel dictionary per RFC 2812\n- Fix: RPL_NOTOPIC (331) now fires TopicChanged with empty topic\n- Fix: INVITE command handling added\n- RPL_TOPICWHOTIME (333) now logged\n- 754 unit tests (42 new)\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/etushar89/IRCDotNet.V2",
